{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1066133-attainments-and-legacies","id":1066133,"title":"Attainments and Legacies?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-21T23:04:11-07:00","id":1066133,"title":"Attainments and Legacies?","content":"I'm not quite sure I understand the segments on Attainments and Legaies in chapter four. Is the text on Attainments supposed to be a description of how Attainments for Legacies should be described (then I think it's placed wrongly in the book), or can characters develope attainments without legacies? <br /> <br /> Maybe I'm missing something here. Or maybe I need a better &quot;how to&quot; on designing legacies...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/373-infernal-teddy","name":"Infernal Teddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar373_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T23:09:01-07:00","id":1066134,"title":"","content":"Not sure which part you're referring to since I don't have my books with me, but there are indeed Attainments you can gain without Legacies. Those would be Arcanum Attainments. You get them automatically for free once you obtain a certain number of dots in an Arcanum. Is that what you are looking at?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T23:11:13-07:00","id":1066136,"title":"","content":"There are attainments granted by arcana that come automatically with arcana ratings that don't require a legacy. Most of them impart some level of protection or utility benefit, but none of them are based on spells.<br /> <br /> Then there are attainments that are developed in legacies that are based off of Praxes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-21T23:53:30-07:00","id":1066148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1066133-attainments-and-legacies?p=1066134#post1066134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure which part you're referring to since I 